senses.gloss:
प्र-चलाक, अस्, m. shooting with arrows, archery;
a peacock's tail; a snake; another poisonous animal;
(आ), f., Ved. a violent shower of rain, a sudden fall
of rain in torrents.

प्रचलायित, अस्, आ, अम्, rolling about, tossing,
tumbling, rolled or tossed about (as in a ship);
nodding the head (while asleep in a sitting posture);
(अम्), n. nodding the head.

प्र-च्छेद, अस्, m., Ved. a cutting, slip, strip;
(according to a Scholiast a piece of grass, such as a
portion of the root, &c.).
